Recommends: polkitd
Description: Show and control LLDP on KDE Plasma
 Shows the switch, port and VLAN this computer is connected to, from what
 neighbors announce over LLDP and LLDP-MED, with a tray icon and
 notifications. It also controls what this computer sends: identity,
 interfaces, timing, LLDP-MED device class, voice and video policies,
 location, Power over Ethernet and custom TLVs, with profiles such as an IP
 phone or an access point to test switch and VLAN policies.
 .
 Experimental. lldpd does the sending and receiving.
